 "notes": [
  "Lane large-buildings-20261120 (2026-11-20). BAG says 1891/1964; the fronts are a 1990s office (backlog row 8). Panel brown #6b6461 sampled from w02-70 (2022-04-25, overcast) between window rows; pavilion glass from the same crop.",
  "Groups: 0 the Weesperstraat (W) front, w01-251L 2019-01-14: eight storeys over a glazed plinth, about 20 punched windows per storey per half; 1 the E front above the pavilion, w02-70; 2 the low glazed pavilion on the E (0-10.5 m) as a curtain wall; 3 the N front, w04-344; 4 the four-storey brick wing N/S (15 m), w06-164L 2024-12-10 (washed out; brick #9c8c7c inferred).",
  "Not modelled: the glazed stair bays with round-headed slots on the W front and the curtain-glazed stair bay on the E (the kit's brick-bay-grid cannot carry a full-height glazed bay inside one group; splitting by surface is not possible because the bays share 3DBAG surfaces), the stepped roof penthouse (window grid)."
